hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"413","Harun ibn Abbad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr yani Ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abi Sahl se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab koi aurat mardon ke darmiyan faut ho aur un ke sath us ke siwa koi aurat na ho, aur koi mard aurton ke darmiyan faut ho aur un ke sath us ke siwa koi mard na ho, to dono ko tayammum karaya jayega aur dafan kiya jayega, aur woh us shakhs ke hukm me hain jise pani na mile."
"414","Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) me woh cheez talash ki jo mayyit me talash ki jati hai to use na paya, to unhon ne kaha: Mere maa baap Aap par qurban hon, Aap zindagi me bhi pakeeza rahe aur maut me bhi."
